item~ function src/mmap.rs :: save :: pub fn save(&mut self) -> io::Result<()> { :: Save to the backing file. Reconstructs the phext from mmap + overlay.  Uses an atomic write: content is written to a temp file in the same directory, fsync'd, then renamed into place. On POSIX, rename(2) is atomic — readers never see a partial write. (Aetheris, P4 patch) :: doc comment
