item+ function src/oauth.rs :: mcp_oauth_hash :: pub fn mcp_oauth_hash(&self, domain: &str, value: &str) -> Option<String> { :: A domain-separated, keyed digest for the MCP OAuth 2.1 store.  Authorization codes, access tokens, refresh tokens, and client secrets are never stored in the clear. Each value is represented by HMAC-SHA256 under the existing session secret, with the caller's domain label mixed in before the value, so a digest minted for one kind of credential cannot be replayed as another. No separate OAuth secret is required: rotating the session secret intentionally invalidates the stored OAuth credentials along with sessions. :: doc comment
